  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chagos Archipelago Maritime Security Capability Needs Assessment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will seek to identify capability gaps within the Mauritian Coast Guard, Fisheries Department, Judiciary and Hydrographic Office which may threaten maritime security in the Chagos Archipelago, thus helping to maintain the archipelago&#x2019;s unique environment and uphold the security of the strategically vital UK-US Base on Diego Garcia.</narrative>
  </description>
